### Obtener todas las tareas
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tareas/
Authorization: Bearer <<TOKEN>>

### 1. Registrar un nuevo usuario (POST)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/registro/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "jaramar1@example.com",
    "password": "123456789",
    "rol":"instructor"
}

### 2. Iniciar sesión (POST)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "jaramar1@example.com",
    "password": "123456789"
}
### 3. Crear una nueva tarea (POST)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tareas/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <<TOKEN>>
{
    "titulo": "Tarea con API Segura",
    "descripcion": "Mi primera tarea usuando JWT de Firebase"
}

### ELIMINAR UNA TAREA POR ID
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/tareas/ID_DE_LA_TAREA/
Authorization: Bearer <<TOKEN>>

###subir la imagen de perfil a clouddinary

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/perfil/imagen/
Authorization: Bearer <<TOKEN>>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MiBoundary
--MiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="imagen"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg
< C:\Users\jaram\OneDrive\Documentos\proyecto_Django\avatar.jpg

--MiBoundary--